          "issue": "ὄντως qualifies θεοῦ as genuinely or actually God. The draft instead introduces an existential formulation, explicitly reinforced by its note describing an assertion of actual existence. This shifts the source's qualification of divine identity into a separate assertion that God exists. Mentioning “the true God” as an alternative does not remedy that shift.",
